      <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-12 lg:space-y-14">
        
        <!-- SECTION 1: APERÇU -->
        <section id="apercu" class="space-y-6">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-950 tracking-tight">
              Explore remote wilderness corridors of Bardia by private 4x4 Jeep
            </h2>
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Embark on a full-day motorized expedition deep into the most secluded, untamed sectors of Bardia National Park. A private 4x4 off-road vehicle enables you to cover vast distances, ford jungle rivers, and access isolated wildlife corridors unreachable on foot within a single day.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Aboard a specially adapted open-top safari vehicle, you are accompanied by an <strong>experienced jungle driver</strong>, a <strong>senior naturalist guide</strong>, and an <strong>elite tracker</strong>. Together, they navigate deep forest trails and alluvial grasslands, tracking fresh nocturnal pugmarks and reading alarm calls across the canopy.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              <strong>The primary focus:</strong> maximizing your chances to encounter the king of the jungle, the <strong>Royal Bengal Tiger</strong>. The mobility of the jeep lets you reach remote strategic spots swiftly (such as the far banks of the Karnali river or secluded observation towers) while vastly increasing opportunities to spot <strong>greater one-horned rhinos</strong>, <strong>wild elephants</strong>, <strong>leopards</strong>, herds of <strong>spotted and sambar deer</strong>, as well as fish-eating gharial crocodiles basking on river sandbanks.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              A bush picnic lunch is shared in the heart of nature atop a secure observation tower overlooking a waterhole or clearing. 100% turnkey experience: all entry permits and official vehicle authorizations are fully handled and included.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- ETHICS & WILD NATURE COMMITMENT -->
          <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200/90 text-amber-950 text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-black text-amber-900 uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">
              <span>⚠️</span>
              <span>100% Wild Nature & Ethical Wildlife Commitment</span>
            </div>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Wildlife roams freely across a pristine ecosystem spanning nearly 1,000 km². Animal movements are entirely natural and unpredictable; no specific sightings can be guaranteed in advance. Our jeep moves at slow, respectful speeds, with engines shut off near observation blinds to protect animal peace and ensure authentic, undisturbed wildlife viewing.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- KEY FACTS CARDS -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 pt-2 text-xs">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
              <span class="text-slate-400 font-bold block uppercase text-[10px]">Duration</span>
